  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of Adam Schiff with the hashtag #treason overlaid, and text labeling him as an \"anti-american democrat\" and \"funded by america-hating george soros.\" This combination of visual and textual elements is designed to attack Schiff personally and politically, using derogatory labels and false accusations to delegitimize his actions and affiliations. The meme employs hateful intent by directly targeting an individual based on his political identity and alleged financial backers, aiming to incite negative sentiment and undermine his credibility. The use of terms like \"treason\" and \"anti-american\" is inflammatory and intended to provoke strong emotional reactions, fitting the definition of a hateful meme as it attacks an individual based on protected characteristics (political affiliation and perceived ideological alignment).",
